graph TD
    style FV fill:#1e3a5f,stroke:#1e40af,color:#fff
    style MC fill:#2563eb,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#fff
    style TP fill:#059669,stroke:#047857,color:#fff
    style DBC fill:#7c3aed,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#fff
    style SA fill:#d97706,stroke:#b45309,color:#fff

    FV[Formal Verification] --> MC[Model Checking\nTLA+ · SPIN · Alloy]
    FV --> TP[Theorem Proving\nDafny · Lean · Coq · Isabelle]
    FV --> DBC[Design by Contract\nEiffel · Dafny · Ada/SPARK]
    FV --> SA[Static Analysis\nAbstract Interpretation]

    MC -->|Best for| MC2["Concurrent and distributed systems\nProtocols · State machines"]
    TP -->|Best for| TP2["Algorithms · Data structures\nSecurity properties"]
    DBC -->|Best for| DBC2["APIs · Invariants\nPre/postconditions"]
    SA -->|Best for| SA2["Type safety · Null safety\nMemory safety"]
